## Component Examples

### Primary Button (replaces pink CTA)

```vue
<button
    class="bg-brand-gold text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-gold-hover font-medium px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors"
>
  Add Listing
</button>
```

### Featured Badge (replaces pink badge)

