## Quick Reference

| Theme element     | Was (pink theme) | Now (client brand)                |
| ----------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------- |
| Primary button    | pink bg          | `#d9a800` gold bg, `#1a2a4a` text |
| Featured badge    | pink bg          | `#d9a800` gold bg, `#1a2a4a` text |
| For Sale tag      | dark gray bg     | `#1a2a4a` navy bg, white text     |
| Active nav link   | pink text        | `#d9a800` gold text               |
| Icon color        | pink             | `#d9a800` gold                    |
| Section underline | pink             | `#d9a800` gold                    |
| Footer (if dark)  | theme default    | `#1a2a4a` navy                    |

